        "@value": "Web Feature Service"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "El estándar de interfaz Web Feature Service (WFS) del Open Geospatial Consortium proporciona una interfaz que permite solicitudes de características geoespaciales a través de la web utilizando mecanismos independientes de la plataforma y es independiente del almacén de datos subyacente."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Open Geospatial Consortium Web Feature Service (WFS) Interface Standard provides an interface allowing requests for geospatial features across the web using platform-independent mechanisms and is independent of the underlying data store."
      }
    ],
