        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Formato de datos XML ligero para el intercambio de datos GPS (puntos de referencia, rutas y tracks) entre aplicaciones y servicios web."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "light-weight XML data format for the interchange of GPS data (waypoints, routes, and tracks) between applications and web services"
      }
