        "@value": "Resource Description Framework N-Triples"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "RDF N-Triples es un formato basado en líneas, de texto plano, para codificar un grafo RDF; una sintaxis concreta para RDF, un subconjunto de Turtle fácil de analizar y basado en líneas."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "RDF N-Triples is a line-based, plain text format for encoding an RDF graph; a concrete syntax for RDF, an easy to parse line-based subset of Turtle."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/n-triples"
